nbsp Fully equipped gym with dedicated yoga zone<br>&nbsp<br> <br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp&nbsp Children's pool and play area<br>&nbsp<br> <br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp&nbsp Barbecue area and community lawn<br>&nbsp<br> <br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp&nbsp Co-working rooms and a library<br>&nbsp<br> <br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp&nbsp Indoor and outdoor cinema<br>&nbsp<br> <br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp&nbsp Putting green<br>&nbsp<br> <br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp&nbsp On-site convenience store<br>&nbsp<br> <br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp&nbsp 24/7 security and concierge lobby<br>&nbsp<br> <br><br><br>&nbsp About Dubai Hills Estate<br><br><br>&nbsp Set across a master-planned 2,700-acre community built around an 18-hole championship golf course managed by Troon Golf, Dubai Hills Estate is one of Emaar's most complete and prestigious developments. The building sits footsteps from the golf course and its iconic clubhouse, with direct access to Dubai Hills Park and Dubai Hills Mall — home to over 650 retail and dining outlets.<br><br><br>&nbsp Dedicated cycling and jogging tracks wind through the community, while top-rated schools, nurseries, and King's College Hospital are all within reach. Al Khail Road keeps you connected to the wider city, with Downtown Dubai roughly 15 minutes away and Dubai Marina around 20 minutes away.<br><br><br>&nbsp An ideal home for professionals and families seeking a balanced, premium lifestyle.<br>","longitude":55.2455416,"negotiator_id":"12196","negotiator_mapping":"nicolas@providentestate.com","parking":["1"],"price":1700000,"price_qualifier":null,"publish":1,"search_type":"sales","slug":"2-bedroom-apartment-for-sale-in-golfville-block-a-golfville-dubai-hills-estate-dubai","status":"For Sale","thumbnail":"http://provident-bx-upload-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/iblock/565/565d54c282bb55a7e8089143682ab773/WhatsApp-Image-2026_07_16-at-5.31.06-PM.jpeg","title":"2 bedroom apartment for sale","extra":{"views":"","cheques":null,"project":null,"bitrix_id":"1